.el .ds Aq '
.TH PDFLUENT 1  "pdfluent 1.1.0" PDFluent
.SH NAME
pdfluent \- PDFluent — PDF toolkit: extract, merge, split, compress, protect, watermark, convert, redact, sign, validate. AGPL\-3.0 or a commercial licence, at your option.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpdfluent\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
PDFluent — PDF toolkit: extract, merge, split, compress, protect, watermark, convert, redact, sign, validate. AGPL\-3.0 or a commercial licence, at your option.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Machine\-readable JSON envelope on stdout
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Quiet: human mode prints data only (no warnings or progress notes)
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Verbose stderr diagnostics (repeat for more)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
pdfluent\-extract(1)
Extract a document as Markdown, JSON, chunks, or text
.TP
pdfluent\-merge(1)
Combine several PDFs into one, in the order given
.TP
pdfluent\-split(1)
Divide a document into separate files
.TP
pdfluent\-pages(1)
Rotate, delete, reorder, or extract pages
.TP
pdfluent\-compress(1)
Reduce file size
.TP
pdfluent\-protect(1)
Set a password and restrict permissions
.TP
pdfluent\-unprotect(1)
Remove password protection
.TP
pdfluent\-watermark(1)
Add a text or image watermark across all pages
.TP
pdfluent\-convert(1)
Convert to Word, Excel, PowerPoint, image, or PDF/A
.TP
pdfluent\-redact(1)
Permanently remove text or regions, not just cover them
.TP
pdfluent\-sign(1)
Apply a PAdES signature with a PKCS#12 identity
.TP
pdfluent\-validate(1)
Validate: parse check, PDF/A conformance, or (unexposed) PDF/UA
.TP
pdfluent\-info(1)
Show document information (page count, PDF version, file size)
.TP
pdfluent\-inspect(1)
Inspect a document and emit JSON (alias of `info \-\-json`)
.TP
pdfluent\-extract\-text(1)
Extract plain text (kept for compatibility; prefer `extract`)
.TP
pdfluent\-doctor(1)
Check environment / installation and print build info
.TP
pdfluent\-models(1)
Install and inspect the opt\-in model tiers\*(Aq files
.TP
pdfluent\-completions(1)
Generate shell completions
.TP
pdfluent\-xfa(1)
Experimental XFA tooling (feature\-gated, not production\-supported)
.SH VERSION
v1.1.0
